# The same person, but here the point is that she is not one thing.
#
# The checker refuses a trait claimed in two rooms unless the two are joined
# by a contrast.  Contradiction is data, not a mistake to be smoothed over.

understand Ada

    role            friend
    met             2019-04

    observed patient
        when      at work, with a shared deadline
        because   stayed late to finish the report with the team
        on        2026-03-14

    observed patient
        when      at home, when plans change
        because   went quiet and left the room
        on        2026-04-02

    contrast patient
        because   at work the deadline is shared, so waiting is shared too; at home it is hers alone, and a change takes it away

end
